    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d123-a1">

                <pb facs="0219" n="99" xml:id="pg99"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister of Foreign
                            Affairs to Ambassador Thompso.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Ministry of Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Rio
                                de Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-06-14"><hi rendition="#italic">June 14,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Ambassador</hi>: With reference to my note of the
                    2d of March ultimo, I have the honor to inform your excellency that the minister
                    of marine has already instructed the captain of the port of Bahia to provide for
                    the retiring of the flag flown by the schooner <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Oliveira</hi>, and on the same occasion he issued a circular to the
                    captains of the ports of the Republic, prohibiting Brazilian shipping from using
                    ensigns which resemble the flag of any country.</p>
                <p>I improve, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio Branco.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
